{"name": "Tony The Mole", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tony the Mole is a cozy underground adventure where you play as a curious little mole with dreams of reaching the surface. Raised by humans in the town of Pebblegrove, Tony sets out on a journey to uncover the town\u2019s secrets, help its quirky residents, and dig his way toward the world above.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dig through dirt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burrow through soft soil and carve tunnels under barriers to uncover new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/bb812a8c6f1b147d7cee63b32137d24d.poster.avif?t=1786143730\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/bb812a8c6f1b147d7cee63b32137d24d.webm?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/bb812a8c6f1b147d7cee63b32137d24d.mp4?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use your mole sense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sniff out earthworms, hidden passages, and secret treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/b79f33669de95204aa7fd7237661bfe7.poster.avif?t=1786143730\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/b79f33669de95204aa7fd7237661bfe7.webm?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/b79f33669de95204aa7fd7237661bfe7.mp4?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Repair quirky gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help townsfolk get their broken contraptions working again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/3b1d93a9ab50328db0f5e356dbbff92b.poster.avif?t=1786143730\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/3b1d93a9ab50328db0f5e356dbbff92b.webm?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/3b1d93a9ab50328db0f5e356dbbff92b.mp4?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mole Fashion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a variety of cute hats to customize Tony\u2019s look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/a56df73d6baada08cd2df0563d875b38.poster.avif?t=1786143730\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/a56df73d6baada08cd2df0563d875b38.webm?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/a56df73d6baada08cd2df0563d875b38.mp4?t=1786143730\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Play as Tony, a curious little mole with a serious digging habit, a taste for worms, and a dream of reaching the surface. Help townsfolk, repair gadgets, collect delightful hats, and explore hidden spaces as you uncover the story of Pebblegrove.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/a394d74139ecbbb197ab906f930318849e30a30c/header.jpg?t=1786143730", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cute", "Adventure", "Wholesome", "Cozy", "Singleplayer", "Exploration"], "developers": "LUCKTAPE Games", "publishers": "LUCKTAPE Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3562370", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "21 July 2026 - Request Access\n\n6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/pDY_dJi6Q5c", "first_seen": 1787672439.555697}